<title>NORWAY: Norway increases 2007 bond by NOK 2.0 bln.</title>
<headline>Norway increases 2007 bond by NOK 2.0 bln.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was annouced by</p>
<p>the Norwegian central bank.</p>
<p>ISSUER: Finance Ministry</p>
<p>AMOUNT: 2.0 billion crowns</p>
<p>COUPON: 6.75 percent</p>
<p>MATURITY: January 15, 2007</p>
<p>AUCTION DATE: May 26</p>
<p>NOTES: The bond, known as S467, is expanded through a so-called</p>
<p>Dutch auction.</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
